vate _permitNonces;\nbytes32 public constant BRIDGE_AND_SWAP_WITNESS_IDENTIFIER = keccak256(\"BridgeAndSwapWitness\");\n+6 more units in this chunk\n```\n\n### across@latest::SpokePoolPeriphery::_paySubmissionFees\n`across@latest` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:421971bf305a3134ebd20fc24530bb7a5a95ecf0 · as_of 2026-08-11T16:57:28Z\nhttps://github.com/across-protocol/contracts/blob/421971bf305a3134ebd20fc24530bb7a5a95ecf0/contracts/periphery/SpokePoolPeriphery.sol#L905-L945\n\n```\nfunction _paySubmissionFees(address feeToken, address recipient, uint256 amount) private\nfunction _isContract(address addr) private view returns (bool)\n(2 units in this chunk)\n```\n\n### across@latest::TronMulticallHandlerTest::__contract__\n`across@latest` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:421971bf305a3134ebd20fc24530bb7a5a95ecf0 · as_of 2026-08-11T16:57:28Z\nhttps://github.com/across-protocol/contracts/blob/421971bf305a3134ebd20fc24530bb7a5a95ecf0/test/evm/foundry/local/TronMulticallHandler.t.sol#L11-L50\n\n```\ncontract TronMulticallHandlerTest is Test {\n    TronMulticallHandler handler;\n```\n\n### across@latest::SpokePoolRelayTest::testCallsMessageHandlerIfRecipientIsContract\n`across@latest` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:421971bf305a3134ebd20fc24530bb7a5a95ecf0 · as_of 2026-08-11T16:57:28Z\nhttps://github.com/across-protocol/contracts/blob/421971bf305a3134ebd20fc24530bb7a5a95ecf0/test/evm/foundry/local/spokepool/SpokePool_Relay.t.sol#L512-L539\n\n```\nfunction testCallsMessageHandlerIfRecipientIsContract() public {\n        MockAcrossMessageHandlerWithEvent messageHandler = new MockAcrossMessageHandlerWithEvent();\n```\n\n### across@latest::SpokePoolFillV5Test::testRevertsWhenSubmitterIsNotExclusiveRelayer\n`across@latest` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:421971bf305a3134ebd20fc24530bb7a5a95ecf0 · as_of 2026-08-11T16:57:28Z\nhttps://github.com/across-protocol/contracts/blob/421971bf305a3134ebd20fc24530bb7a5a95ecf0/test/evm/foundry/local/spokepool/SpokePool_FillV5.t.sol#L265-L296\n\n```\nfunct